@startuml CyberGuardSequenceGenerale
autonumber
title Sequence generale - mini site metier, audit, detection, alerte et analyse SOC

actor "Utilisateur metier" as BusinessUser
actor "Administrateur" as SocUser
participant "Mini site metier" as MiniSite
participant "Controllers mini site" as MiniSiteControllers
participant "MiniSiteDataChangeListener" as Listener
participant "AuditServiceWrapper" as Audit
participant "AttackDetectionService" as DetectService
participant "DetectionRuleEngine" as RuleEngine
participant "GeoService" as Geo
participant "AutoBlockService" as AutoBlock
participant "Base de donnees" as DB
participant "Dashboard / Alertes / Incidents" as Supervision

BusinessUser -> MiniSite : consulter ou modifier une donnee
MiniSite -> MiniSiteControllers : requete securisee
MiniSiteControllers -> DB : enregistrer la donnee
MiniSiteControllers -> Listener : evenement de changement metier

Listener -> Audit : journaliser l'action metier
Audit -> DB : creer AuditLog

alt contenu ou motif suspect
  Listener -> DetectService : detectAttack(SQL Injection ou XSS, contexte)
  DetectService -> RuleEngine : detectByRule(rule_id, contexte)
  RuleEngine -> Geo : lookup(source_ip)
  Geo --> RuleEngine : pays / ville / coordonnees
  RuleEngine -> DB : creer Attack
  RuleEngine -> DB : creer Alert
  RuleEngine -> AutoBlock : evaluateAttack(attack)

  alt seuil de blocage atteint
    AutoBlock -> DB : creer ou mettre a jour BlockedIp
    AutoBlock -> DB : passer Attack.status = blocked
    AutoBlock -> DB : creer alerte de blocage
  else pas de blocage
    AutoBlock --> RuleEngine : pas d'action defensive
  end
else aucune detection
  Listener --> MiniSiteControllers : audit seul
end

SocUser -> Supervision : ouvrir dashboard / alertes / incidents
Supervision -> DB : lire attaques, alertes, audits et stats
DB --> Supervision : donnees consolidees
Supervision --> SocUser : affichage du contexte et des priorites

@enduml
